// 3 Actor1 :
"P2237669135" "<t=5 d=5>Alright... Hamidon... You remember me... you... REMEMBER... ME!"
// 2 Actor1 :
"P3704530680" "<t=5 d=5>I... AM... DOCTOR... RAYMOND... KEYES!!!"
// 4 Caption :
"P2331309639" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=4 d=4><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor DarkOliveGreen>SUIT DESTRUCTION IN T-T-T"
